{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1771218557962,"sessionID":"ses_39b28f7acffeLHlrypWKneG5Bj","part":{"id":"prt_c64d9a77a001wZ1MDqUtuBDBtl","sessionID":"ses_39b28f7acffeLHlrypWKneG5Bj","messageID":"msg_c64d95932001EIAqaWUJl7M55r","type":"tool","callID":"call_b081decc55db4b06b0fb3e7f","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Find retry mechanism code","prompt":"Search the codebase in /home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src for any retry mechanism implementations:\n1. Exponential backoff implementations\n2. Retry logic for failed operations\n3. Graceful degradation patterns\n\nLook for:\n- Functions with \"retry\" in the name\n- Patterns like `setTimeout` used for retry\n- Any error handling that includes retry logic\n- Fetch or network operations that might need retry\n\nReturn a summary of:\n- What retry mechanisms exist (if any)\n- What operations could benefit from retry logic\n- File locations for any retry-related code","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"task_id: ses_39b26587bffeQMKDH5vmZorRO1 (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\nBased on my thorough search of the codebase in `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src`, here is a comprehensive summary of retry mechanism implementations:\n\n## Summary of Findings\n\n### **Retry Mechanisms Currently Implemented: NONE**\n\nThe codebase does **not** contain any explicit retry mechanism implementations, including:\n- No exponential backoff implementations\n- No retry logic for failed operations\n- No retry-specific functions (no functions with \"retry\" in the name)\n\n---\n\n### **What EXISTS (Error Handling Without Retry):**\n\n#### 1. **Error Boundary** (`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/ErrorBoundary.tsx`)\n- **Purpose**: Catches React component errors\n- **Current behavior**: Displays error UI and offers a \"Reload Page\" button\n- **No retry logic**: Simply reloads the entire page on error\n- **Lines 24-46**: Error catching and reset handling\n\n#### 2. **localStorage Error Handling** (`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/state.ts`)\n- **Functions**: `saveToLocalStorage`, `loadFromLocalStorage`, `removeFromLocalStorage`\n- **Current behavior**: Catches errors and logs to console, returns defaults or `false`\n- **No retry logic**: Operations fail silently without retry attempts\n- **Lines 79-113**: Storage operations with try-catch blocks\n\n#### 3. **High Score Storage Error Handling** (`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/level.ts`)\n- **Functions**: `loadHighScores`, `saveHighScores`, `saveHighScore`, `getHighScore`\n- **Current behavior**: Catches errors and logs warnings\n- **No retry logic**: High score saving fails silently\n- **Lines 130-163**: High score persistence with error handling\n\n#### 4. **AudioContext Error Handling** (`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/audio.ts`)\n- **Function**: `ensureAudioContext` (line 248-264)\n- **Current behavior**: Catches errors when creating/resuming AudioContext\n- **No retry logic**: Fails silently, audio becomes unavailable\n- **Lines 67-69, 96-98, 130-132, 158-160, 187-189, 215-217, 243-245**: Multiple try-catch blocks for sound playback\n\n---\n\n### **setTimeout/setInterval Usage (NOT for Retry):**\n\nFound **17 setTimeout/setInterval** occurrences, all for **timing/animations** (not retry logic):\n\n| File | Lines | Purpose |\n|------|-------|---------|\n| `Game.tsx` | 217, 228, 285 | Game phase transitions, simulation interval |\n| `ScoreDisplay.tsx` | 58, 66 | Score animation effects |\n| `useTripleTapGesture.ts` | 49 | Gesture timeout |\n| `VictoryScreen.tsx` | 27 | Victory display delay |\n| `GridInteraction.tsx` | 89 | Invalid action indicator |\n| `useTransition.ts` | 59, 62, 66, 104, 108, 112, 121 | Transition animations |\n| `usePhaseTimer.ts` | 24 | Countdown timer |\n| `IntroOverlay.tsx` | 9 | Intro animation |\n\n---\n\n### **Operations That COULD Benefit from Retry Logic:**\n\n#### 1. **localStorage Operations** (High Priority)\n**Files**: \n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/state.ts` (lines 79-113)\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/level.ts` (lines 130-163)\n\n**Why retry needed**:\n- localStorage can be temporarily unavailable (quota exceeded, private mode, storage disabled)\n- Failures silently lose user data (settings, high scores)\n- Could use exponential backoff with 3-5 retry attempts\n\n#### 2. **AudioContext Initialization** (Medium Priority)\n**File**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/audio.ts` (lines 248-264)\n\n**Why retry needed**:\n- AudioContext can be blocked by autoplay policies\n- May require user interaction before succeeding\n- Could retry with exponential backoff after user interaction\n\n#### 3. **Error Recovery** (Low Priority)\n**File**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/ErrorBoundary.tsx` (lines 38-46)\n\n**Why retry needed**:\n- Some errors are transient (network issues, temporary browser quirks)\n- Could attempt to remount components before reloading page\n\n---\n\n### **Network Operations: NONE**\n\nThe application is entirely **client-side with no external dependencies**:\n- No API calls (no `fetch`, `axios`, or network requests)\n- No WebSocket connections\n- No external service integrations\n- Only browser APIs: localStorage, AudioContext, DOM APIs\n\n---\n\n### **Recommendations:**\n\nIf retry mechanisms are to be added, I recommend implementing:\n\n1. **Generic retry utility function** with exponential backoff\n2. **Wrapper functions** for localStorage operations with retry logic\n3. **Retry mechanism for AudioContext** initialization\n4. **Consider** graceful degradation for non-critical operations (like audio)\n\nWould you like me to provide example implementations for any of these retry mechanisms?\n</task_result>","title":"Find retry mechanism code","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39b26587bffeQMKDH5vmZorRO1","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false}