{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1771218575286,"sessionID":"ses_39b28f7acffeLHlrypWKneG5Bj","part":{"id":"prt_c64d9bf08001OZik6jelgFf7QM","sessionID":"ses_39b28f7acffeLHlrypWKneG5Bj","messageID":"msg_c64d95932001EIAqaWUJl7M55r","type":"tool","callID":"call_f89477c83e34429299d5fa18","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Find keyboard navigation code","prompt":"Search the codebase in /home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src for keyboard navigation implementations:\n1. Arrow key handling\n2. Tab navigation\n3. Enter/Space key actions\n4. Escape key handlers\n5. Focus management\n\nLook for:\n- `keydown` event listeners\n- `e.key === 'Arrow...'` checks\n- `e.code` checks\n- Focus-related code (focus, blur, autoFocus)\n- tabIndex attributes\n- ARIA attributes related to keyboard navigation\n\nReturn a summary of:\n- What keyboard navigation exists (if any)\n- What keyboard interactions are missing\n- File locations for keyboard-related code\n- Components that need keyboard navigation","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"task_id: ses_39b2640f0ffeHaVbiYRm9KrQme (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\nBased on my comprehensive search of the codebase, here is the complete analysis of keyboard navigation implementations:\n\n---\n\n## Keyboard Navigation Analysis Summary\n\n### What Keyboard Navigation Currently Exists\n\n| Feature | Location | Details |\n|---------|----------|---------|\n| **Transition Skip** | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/hooks/useTransition.ts` (lines 91-96) | Space or Escape to skip level transitions |\n| **Global Shortcuts** | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/Game.tsx` (lines 98-112) | Backtick (`) toggles Settings, 'G' toggles grid lines |\n| **ARIA Label** | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/UIToggleButton.tsx` (line 13) | Only aria-label for UI toggle button |\n| **Focus Styles** | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/ErrorBoundary.css` (line 58), `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/styles/SettingsPanel.css` (line 243) | Limited focus styles on 2 elements only |\n\n---\n\n### What Keyboard Navigation is Missing\n\n#### 1. **Arrow Key Handling**\n- ❌ No arrow key navigation for grid cells\n- ❌ No arrow key navigation through UI controls\n\n#### 2. **Tab Navigation**\n- ❌ No `tabIndex` attributes found anywhere\n- ❌ No explicit tab order management\n- ❌ No focus trapping for modals\n\n#### 3. **Enter/Space Key Actions**\n- ⚠️ Space only works for transitions\n- ❌ No Enter key activation for buttons\n- ❌ Interactive buttons (HUD, modals) cannot be activated via keyboard\n\n#### 4. **Escape Key Handlers**\n- ⚠️ Escape only works for transition skip\n- ❌ No Escape to close modals (SettingsPanel, VictoryScreen, IntroOverlay)\n\n#### 5. **Focus Management**\n- ❌ No `autoFocus` attributes\n- ❌ No `focus()` JavaScript calls\n- ❌ No focus trapping for modal dialogs\n- ❌ No focus return to trigger elements when modals close\n\n#### 6. **ARIA Navigation Attributes**\n- Only 1 of many needed ARIA attributes present\n- ❌ No `aria-haspopup` for buttons that open modals\n- ❌ No `aria-expanded` for toggle buttons\n- ❌ No `aria-modal` for modal dialogs\n- ❌ No `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby` for most buttons\n- ❌ No `aria-controls` for elements that control others\n\n---\n\n### File Locations for Keyboard-Related Code\n\n**With existing keyboard implementations:**\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/hooks/useTransition.ts` - Transition skip (Space/Escape)\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/Game.tsx` - Global shortcuts (Backtick, G key)\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/UIToggleButton.tsx` - aria-label\n\n**With focus styling only:**\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/ErrorBoundary.css` - button focus style\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/styles/SettingsPanel.css` - select focus style\n\n---\n\n### Components That Need Keyboard Navigation\n\n| Component | Priority | Needed Features |\n|-----------|----------|-----------------|\n| **GridInteraction** | HIGH | Arrow keys to navigate cells, Space/Enter to toggle cells |\n| **GlassHUD** | HIGH | Tab navigation, Enter/Space to activate all buttons, focus styles |\n| **SettingsPanel** | HIGH | Escape to close, focus trap, Enter to activate buttons, auto focus on open |\n| **VictoryScreen** | MEDIUM | Escape to close, focus trap, Enter/Space to activate Play Again |\n| **IntroOverlay** | MEDIUM | Enter/Space to activate ENTER VOID button |\n| **ErrorBoundary** | LOW | Escape to close, proper focus management |\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n\nThe Game of Life application has **minimal keyboard navigation support**:\n- 2 global shortcuts (Backtick, G key)\n- Transition skip with Space/Escape\n- Only 1 aria-label across the entire codebase\n- No tab navigation, focus management, or proper modal keyboard handling\n- The grid itself cannot be navigated with arrow keys (only mouse/touch)\n- HUD buttons cannot be activated via keyboard\n\nFor accessibility compliance and keyboard-only users, the application requires significant keyboard navigation improvements, particularly for the **grid interaction** and **all UI controls**.\n</task_result>","title":"Find keyboard navigation code","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39b2640f0ffeHaVbiYRm9KrQme","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771218517773,"end":1771218575285}}}}
