Button focus outline\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/styles/SettingsPanel.css` (Line 243) - Select focus style\n\n### Semantic HTML\n- Proper use of `<button>`, `<h1>`, `<h2>`, `<h3>` elements throughout\n- Form controls properly associated with labels using `htmlFor` and `id` in SettingsPanel.tsx\n\n### HTML Meta Tags\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/index.html`\n  - `lang=\"en\"` attribute\n  - Viewport meta tag for responsive design\n  - Description meta tag\n\n---\n\n## **ARIA ATTRIBUTES PRESENT**\n\n| Attribute | Count | Location |\n|-----------|-------|----------|\n| `aria-label` | 1 | UIToggleButton.tsx |\n| `aria-live` | 0 | None |\n| `role` | 0 | None |\n| `alt` | 0 | None |\n| `aria-pressed` | 0 | None |\n| `aria-expanded` | 0 | None |\n| `aria-describedby` | 0 | None |\n| `aria-labelledby` | 0 | None |\n| `aria-hidden` | 0 | None |\n\n---\n\n## **ACCESSIBILITY FEATURES MISSING**\n\n### Critical Issues\n1. **No ARIA live regions** for dynamic content updates (score, timer, phase changes, flux levels)\n2. **No role attributes** on custom components\n3. **No screen reader announcements** for game state changes\n4. **No keyboard navigation** for the canvas-based grid\n5. **No focus management** for modals/overlays (VictoryScreen, TransitionOverlay, IntroOverlay, SettingsPanel)\n6. **No aria-hidden** on decorative SVG icons in UIToggleButton.tsx\n\n### Moderate Issues\n7. **No aria-pressed** on toggle buttons (Draw/Erase mode buttons)\n8. **No aria-expanded** on the settings panel toggle\n9. **No aria-valuenow/min/max** for slider controls (though native `<input type=\"range\">` used)\n10. **No keyboard shortcuts** documented or announced to users\n11. **No skip links** to main content\n12. **No aria-label** on buttons with only emoji (⚙️ settings button)\n\n### Additional Improvements Needed\n13. **No tab order management** for custom components\n14. **No visible focus indicators** on many buttons (only ErrorBoundary has them)\n15. **No error announcements** for validation errors\n16. **Canvas grid is not accessible** - needs an alternative representation for screen readers\n17. **No aria-live region** for countdown timer changes\n18. **No aria-live region** for phase transitions (PLANNING → COUNTDOWN → RUNNING → FINISHED)\n19. **No aria-live region** for score changes and milestones\n20. **No aria-live region** for flux depletion warnings\n\n---\n\n## **FILE LOCATIONS FOR ACCESSIBILITY CODE**\n\n### Existing Accessibility Features\n- **ARIA labels:** `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/UIToggleButton.tsx`\n- **Reduced motion CSS:** `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/styles/index.css`, `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/styles/GlassHUD.css`, `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/ErrorBoundary.css`\n- **Focus styles:** `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/ErrorBoundary.css`, `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/styles/SettingsPanel.css`\n\n### Files Needing Accessibility Improvements\n\n| Component | File | Issues |\n|-----------|------|--------|\n| Canvas Grid | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/CanvasGrid.tsx` | Canvas needs aria-label, keyboard navigation, live region for cell changes |\n| Grid Interaction | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/GridInteraction.tsx` | No keyboard interaction, no announcements for cell placement/removal |\n| Glass HUD | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/GlassHUD.tsx` | Status displays need live regions (Phase, Timer, Cells, Flux) |\n| Score Display | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/ScoreDisplay.tsx` | Needs aria-live for score updates and milestones |\n| Flux Display | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/FluxDisplay.tsx` | Needs aria-live for flux depletion warnings |\n| Transition Overlay | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/TransitionOverlay.tsx` | Needs aria-live for level completion announcements |\n| Victory Screen | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/VictoryScreen.tsx` | Needs role=\"alertdialog\", aria-modal, focus management |\n| Intro Overlay | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/IntroOverlay.tsx` | Needs role=\"dialog\", aria-labelledby |\n| Settings Panel | `/home/ochanomu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/SettingsPanel.tsx` | Needs aria-expanded, focus trap, announcements |\n| Game (Main) | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/Game.tsx` | Needs keyboard shortcuts documentation, announcements for all game state changes |\n| Level Stats | `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/LevelStats.tsx` | Needs live region for stats updates |\n\n---\n\n## **COMPONENTS NEEDING SCREEN READER SUPPORT**\n\n### High Priority\n1. **CanvasGrid/GridInteraction** - Core game interaction not accessible via keyboard or screen reader\n2. **GlassHUD** - Real-time status information not announced\n3. **ScoreDisplay** - Score changes and milestones not announced\n4. **FluxDisplay** - Resource depletion not announced\n\n### Medium Priority\n5. **VictoryScreen** - Game completion not properly announced as a modal\n6. **TransitionOverlay** - Level transitions not announced\n7. **SettingsPanel** - Panel state not communicated, focus not managed\n8. **Game (Main)** - Phase changes, countdown, timer not announced\n\n### Lower Priority\n9. **IntroOverlay** - Entry screen could be more descriptive\n10. **UIToggleButton** - SVG icons should have aria-hidden=\"true\"\n\n---\n\n## **RECOMMENDATIONS**\n\n1. Add `aria-live=\"polite\"` regions for score, flux, timer, and phase changes\n2. Implement keyboard navigation for the grid (arrow keys + Enter/Space to toggle cells)\n3. Add `role=\"grid\"` and proper cell structure for the canvas\n4. Add focus management for all modals/overlays\n5. Add `aria-label` to icon-only buttons\n6. Add `aria-pressed` to mode toggle buttons\n7. Add `aria-expanded` to the settings panel\n8. Document keyboard shortcuts for screen reader users\n9. Consider adding a visually-hidden screen reader announcements component\n10. Ensure all interactive elements have visible focus indicators\n</task_result>","title":"Find screen reader support code","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39b2640e2ffemzvMH6VU66ufy6","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771218517787,"end":1771218592902}}}}
